{"text": "On March 1, 1919. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Doctor Schofield heard people. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Shouting for Korean independence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In Tapgol Park. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He took pictures of the event. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With his camera. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He then wrote an article about the historic event. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And sent it to foreign newspapers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With his pictures. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Doctor Schofields fight for Korean independence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Did not stop. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Even after the March 1st Movement. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He continued to write. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> About the terrible situation in Korea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For foreign newspapers. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was under the watchful eye of the Japanese police. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So he had to go back to Canada. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In 1920. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In 1958. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He returned to Korea. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the invitation of the Korean government. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And never left again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> For the rest of his life. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He worked hard to help Koreans. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Especially poor students. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Doctor Schofield died in April 1970. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And he was buried. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In Seoul National Cemetery.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", " ", "M", "a", "r", "c", "h", " ", "1", ",", " ", "1", "9", "1", "9", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "D", "o", "c", "t", "o", "r", " ", "S", "c", "h", "o", "f", "i", "e", "l", "d", " ", "h", "e", "a", "r", "d", " ", "p", "e", "o", "p", "l", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "S", "h", "o", "u", "t", "i", "n", "g", " ", "